# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# The finale: a slime zig-zag, an ice slide onto a gulper's landing, a tidal strip,
# and a spring up to the last socket. Everything once more, in the warm light.
name: The Long Way Home
time: 90
theme: dawn
tide: 6 0.4 -0.2
eater: 7,10 10,10 speed 0.9 chase 1.2
story: The last one. It knows the way home, even if you do not.
story: Everything you have learned is down there somewhere. Follow it.
ending: Twelve marbles. Every one of them accounted for.
ending: It was never really madness. Just a long way round.
ending: Welcome back.
